#: ../../config/options_os_x.rst:4
msgid "macOS"
msgstr "macOS"

#: ../../config/options_os_x.rst:6
msgid "In macOS, the CD Lookup option is currently a text field. The device is usually ``/dev/rdisk1``."
msgstr "在 macOS 中，CD 查找选项目前是一个文本字段。设备通常是 ``/dev/rdisk1``。"

#: ../../config/options_os_x.rst:8
msgid "If that doesn't work, one way is to simply keep increasing the number (e.g. ``/dev/rdisk2``) until it does work. A less trial and error method is to open \"Terminal\" and type ``mount``. The output should include a line such as::"
msgstr ""
"如果不起作用，一种方法是一次性增加数字（例如 ``/dev/rdisk2``），直到它起作用"
"。一种不太依赖试错的方 法是打开 \"终端\" 并输入 ``mount``。输出应包括类似以下"
"内容的行："

#: ../../config/options_os_x.rst:12
msgid "You need to replace ``/dev/disk`` with ``/dev/rdisk``, so if, for example, it says ``/dev/disk2``, you should enter ``/dev/rdisk2`` in Picard's preferences."
msgstr ""
"您需要将 ``/dev/disk`` 替换为 ``/dev/rdisk``，所以如果，例如，它显示 ``/dev/"
"disk2``，您应在 Picard 的首选项中输入 ``/dev/rdisk2``。"
